tars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9419498443603516,"text_excerpt":"This is Starbucks at Poydras and St. Charles. It is an awesome and smaller location than the one a few blocks away at 700 Canal. A bit less crowded and touristy. The beverages are amazing. Got my red holiday reusable cup though I missed the launch so I am happy!!!! Baristas are kind and friendly. Location is great to work in or pass time enjoying a tasty beverage. You'll love this location too!!!"},{"business_id":"LjXS6sgzY6-kX2WKPykx_A","review_id":"PyNAMqa8nk7tZ06koi8STQ","date":"2016-07-18T23:10:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9341845512390137,"text_excerpt":"This is a full-sized Starbucks, not a cart or hut. I love this location! The employees are all super friendly and have been from the get-go. The various batistas quickly learned my order and always make me feel welcome. They have typical Starbucks fare...cups, mugs, snacks. And a pretty good selection of breakfast and lunch foods. When new drinks come out, they are quick to offer samples. There's lots of coffee competition on this block, but if you're a diehard Starbuckser on Poydras...your coffee dreams have finally come true!"},{"business_id":"LjXS6sgzY6-kX2WKPykx_A","review_id":"v9vL-d2CbK00-jvfWKV0Iw","date":"2018-09-05T21:04:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9188158512115479,"text_excerpt":"This Starbucks is conveniently located in the Central Business District in Nola. With close proximity to most of the major hotels and business, banks and high rises in the area. We were famished walking around looking for a breakfast spot. It was Memorial Day and so many places were closed. We found ourselves lost in the area until we spotted a Starbucks and decided to go in and refuel with a coffee or snack. My party of four all bought coffee, frappes and I got a new cold brew that just came out with a froth on top. It was so good and I wished I would have bought a Venti but then remembered this was just a quick stop. Besides the cool drinks what set this Starbucks apart was the service ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"LjXS6sgzY6-kX2WKPykx_A","photo_id":"EKNaNn-iB1YUPwBs_zS_FQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/EKNaNn-iB1YUPwBs_zS_FQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9482922554016113},{"business_id":"LjXS6sgzY6-kX2WKPykx_A","photo_id":"ZuTnv_-6-AKE_9owC4X9QA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZuTnv_-6-AKE_9owC4X9QA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9177311658859253},{"business_id":"LjXS6sgzY6-kX2WKPykx_A","photo_id":"rmsCmUIWW22SxbHmDHuvZA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/rmsCmUIWW22SxbHmDHuvZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9144520163536072},{"business_id":"LjXS6sgzY6-kX2WKPykx_A","photo_id":"z6PQ77J_0x2NOJA7wEz6wA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/z6PQ77J_0x2NOJA7wEz6wA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.884351372718811},{"business_id":"LjXS6sgzY6-kX2WKPykx_A","photo_id":"qChuqD6MXNGYaB00sgKuTg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qChuqD6MXNGYaB00sgKuTg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7913428544998169}]},"notebook_case":null}
